                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Study 6: In the eyes of the learner: Eye-tracking augmented debriefing in simulation. Twenty-two Emergency Medicine residents participated over the course of 2 resuscitation-based objective structured clinical examinations (Aug 2016 and Feb 2017) in a high-fidelity patient simulation laboratory. 13 residents completed both sets of examinations. Study participants were outfitted with mobile eye-tracking glasses."
                },
